## Title: Does This Thing Go Any Faster?
## Author: Th3rtythr33
## Version: 1.12.0
## AddOnVersion: 13
## APIVersion: 101051
## SavedVariables: DoesThisThingGoAnyFasterSaved
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20200
## Description: Shows an on-screen indicator whenever your mount is sprinting. With LibHarvensAddonSettings installed, the Add-Ons settings menu lets you choose the text and whether the mount stamina bar turns gold.

; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; MANIFEST NOTES
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; AddOnVersion is an integer that must only ever INCREASE, and it steps by one
; per PUBLISHED build regardless of how far the semantic Version jumps. It is
; what the console catalogue uses; Version is only ever shown to humans.
; 1.11.0 shipped as AddOnVersion 12, so 1.12.0 is 13.
;
; .addon only, no .txt: console-only addon, and the console client has
; ignored .txt manifests since June 2025.
;
; PlayStation's filesystem is case-sensitive. Every path listed below, and the
; folder and manifest names themselves, must match the real files exactly.
;
; Description must stay ONE line and should match the Bethesda.net listing.
;
; OptionalDependsOn, not DependsOn, by request: the addon works in full
; without LibHarvensAddonSettings (the defaults reproduce 1.11.0 exactly);
; the library only adds the settings menu. The trade-off is that the console
; will not auto-install the library for players who do not already have it.
; The minimum is pinned to the library's LATEST release (2.2.0 = 20200, still
; current on ESOUI as of 2026-10-06) per ESOUI best practice; raise it
; whenever LHAS updates.
;
; APIVersion tracks the live game. 101051 = Update 51, live 2026-09-28.
;
; SavedVariables holds two stores in one table: per-character calibration
; ceilings (ZO_SavedVars:New) and account-wide display preferences
; (ZO_SavedVars:NewAccountWide, namespace "Display").
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

